{"4604530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demons of Asteborg DX", "steam_appid": 4604530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knights, sharpen your blades, a new scourge is descending upon the kingdom of Asteborg!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Gareth, a knight of the royal guard with a mysterious past, and use your sword and spells to defeat Zadimus’s demon army in this modern action-platformer with retro-inspired gameplay!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/be24d673cac74e41a5a065433c701baf.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/be24d673cac74e41a5a065433c701baf.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/be24d673cac74e41a5a065433c701baf.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The ultimate version of Neofid Studios' first game is here! <br> - Over 10 levels to rediscover <br>- 4 playable characters <br>- 3 game modes <br>- 80 enemies to face <br>- Revamped difficulty <br>- Polished pixel art and an exclusive retro soundtrack <br>- Secrets galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/ac6d448ac974d772f6670fc51f6995b1.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/ac6d448ac974d772f6670fc51f6995b1.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/ac6d448ac974d772f6670fc51f6995b1.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Use Gareth’s wide range of actions</strong><br> Jump, roll, swim, climb, and slice your opponents  to pieces in this challenging action-platformer.<br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/95da902b5e476a7c5ce31e6bee84705c.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/95da902b5e476a7c5ce31e6bee84705c.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/95da902b5e476a7c5ce31e6bee84705c.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Face off against fearsome bosses</strong> <br> A mad executioner, a pile of bewitched corpses, or a stone dragon—each battle requires a different strategy. Will you emerge victorious from the arena?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/a1befe2f023b79fcb2c67f293439fe39.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/a1befe2f023b79fcb2c67f293439fe39.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/a1befe2f023b79fcb2c67f293439fe39.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Master unique powers</strong> <br> Launch fireballs, walk on air, or stop time.  Use these magical powers to progress through the game’s 11 levels.<br><br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/8bb8e75c35c51ee1e396a27be05f534d.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/8bb8e75c35c51ee1e396a27be05f534d.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/8bb8e75c35c51ee1e396a27be05f534d.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Upgrade your gear</strong><br>  A shop is available between each level; spend the money you’ve earned on your quest to obtain powerful artifacts or extra lives<br><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/c9b9d97f4ce4dbcc8e4b2550efdbe8ba.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/c9b9d97f4ce4dbcc8e4b2550efdbe8ba.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/c9b9d97f4ce4dbcc8e4b2550efdbe8ba.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Uncover all of Asteborg’s secrets</strong><br>  Exploring the vast world of Asteborg will be rewarded—find the wooden planks to build a boat and reach a secret level.  Hidden items might just help you defeat your enemies more easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/aa72e9a0964df96e5970f4dc0092d89f.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/aa72e9a0964df96e5970f4dc0092d89f.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/aa72e9a0964df96e5970f4dc0092d89f.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knights, sharpen your blades, a new scourge is descending upon the kingdom of Asteborg!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Gareth, a knight of the royal guard with a mysterious past, and use your sword and spells to defeat Zadimus’s demon army in this modern action-platformer with retro-inspired gameplay!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/be24d673cac74e41a5a065433c701baf.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/be24d673cac74e41a5a065433c701baf.webm?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/be24d673cac74e41a5a065433c701baf.mp4?t=1782784883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The ultimate version of Neofid Studios' first game is here! <br> - Over 10 levels to rediscover <br>- 4 playable characters <br>- 3 game modes <br>- 80 enemies to face <br>- Revamped difficulty <br>- Polished pixel art and an exclusive retro soundtrack <br>- Secrets galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4604530/extras/ac6d448ac974d772f6670fc51f6995b1.poster.avif?t=1782784883\" width=9